    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "It's all about light! Light from a lamp or a window bounces off you, in every direction.",
      "punch": "light",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "💡",
        "text": "Light bounces off you",
        "cue": "bounces",
        "sub": "In every direction",
        "sub_cue": "direction"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Light bounces? Like a ball?"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Just like a ball! Some of that light travels to the mirror. And a mirror is super smooth and shiny.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🪞",
        "text": "Super smooth and shiny",
        "cue": "smooth"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "So the light hits the mirror and bounces straight back, nice and neat, into your eyes. And your eyes see... you!",
      "board": {
        "type": "journey",
        "title": "Light's trip",
        "traveler": "✨",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "💡",
            "label": "Light",
            "cue": "light"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🪞",
            "label": "Mirror",
            "cue": "mirror"
          },
          {
            "icon": "img:Human_physiology/Servier/eye",
            "label": "Your eyes",
            "cue": "eyes"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Then why can't I see myself in my t-shirt?"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "A mirror is smooth, so light bounces back neatly. Your t-shirt is bumpy up close, so light scatters every which way.",
      "board": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": {
          "label": "Mirror",
          "items": [
            {
              "icon": "✨",
              "text": "Smooth",
              "cue": "smooth"
            },
            {
              "icon": "✅",
              "text": "Neat bounce",
              "cue": "neatly"
            }
          ]
        },
        "right": {
          "label": "T-shirt",
          "items": [
            {
              "icon": "👕",
              "text": "Bumpy",
              "cue": "bumpy"
            },
            {
              "icon": "🔀",
              "text": "Scatters",
              "cue": "scatters"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "What's a mirror made of?"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Usually glass, with a very thin, shiny layer of metal on the back. The glass keeps the metal smooth and safe.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "✨",
        "text": "Glass + shiny metal",
        "cue": "glass",
        "sub": "Metal layer on the back",
        "sub_cue": "metal"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Hey, when I hold up a word to the mirror, the letters look backwards!"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "That's because a mirror flips things around. Try holding up your name and see!",
      "punch": "flips",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🔄",
        "text": "Words look backwards!",
        "cue": "flips",
        "sub": "Try it with your name",
        "sub_cue": "name"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "So light bounces off me, hits the smooth mirror, and comes back to my eyes!",
      "board": {
